      "failure_charge_rule": "For success, charged counters equal observed exact counters. For abnormal termination, operation counters charge 10^12 each, optimizer/verifier nodes charge their cap, CPU/wall/RSS/I/O/storage charge the exact development ceiling. Observed lower bounds remain separate.",
